  "features": [
    "AsyncLocalStorage.run restores the actual outer snapshot even when a callback disables storage or replaces its context.",
    "AsyncLocalStorage.exit preserves disabled status and other storage instances, with callback validation before mutation.",
    "Native regression verifies prior store leak/crash, nested exit and exceptions, promise/snapshot/resource propagation and disable behavior."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Two upstream TODOs are retained separately, without passing credit.",
    "The old Home baseline crashes after disable within run; the new regression also fails on the prior first-run store leak.",
    "Node controls differ by async-context backend: its async-hooks mode passes the native regression, while its newer frame mode retains captured stores after disable. Controls are retained without claiming universal equivalence.",
    "Actual frame materialization remains #871; createHook/native API gaps, complete Bun suite and Release/ASAN/all-platform verification remain open under #66."
  ],
